        },
        {
          "text": "“An Alufa kede Omega,” man kop a Rwot Obaŋa, en ame tye, ame yam tye con, dok ame bino bino, en Won Twer Ducu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.8",
